    "criterion": "Before treating a [!tag] line as an admonition continuation, md_process_line() must ensure ctx->n_containers > 0 so the later ctx->containers[ctx->n_containers-1] access has a live container entry to index.",
    "description": "The vulnerable admonition gate checks parser flags, current_block, and n_block_bytes but omits the live-container guard. On the crashing witness the quote container has already been dropped, so ctx->n_containers is 0 when the admonition body executes."
  },
